SUMMARY:Post: Company page announcement (LinkedIn · Midas Tech)
DESCRIPTION:Post for LinkedIn · Midas Tech (AI & Cybersecurity).\nOpen S
 ocial Posts to copy the text and image: https://midastechinc.github.io/L
 eads/\n\n1. Go to the Midas Tech company page (linkedin.com/company/mida
 stech786) and click Create → Start a post\, so it posts as the company
 \, not you.\n2. Paste the post.\n3. Add the image.\n4. Check it says Pos
 t to Anyone\, then click Post.\n5. Right after posting\, add the first c
 omment under your post.\n6. Come back here and click Mark as posted.
URL:https://midastechinc.github.io/Leads/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
TRIGGER:-PT15M
DESCRIPTION:Time to post: Company page announcement
